            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Marc Antony</strong><br>\nMarc Antony was born in Rome in 83 BC into a family that was both distinguished and troubled. His father, also named Marcus Antonius, had a reputation for military skill and governance but also for being indecisive in politics. Antony's mother, Julia, came from a line that claimed to descend from the gods. As a young man, Antony spent time in Greece, where he learned about its culture and military tactics, which shaped his future career as a politician and general.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Antony's Military Beginnings</strong><br>\nAntony began his military career serving under Aulus Gabinius in Syria and Egypt. During his service, he demonstrated considerable military prowess, which helped him advance his position. He then became a cavalry commander, supporting Julius Caesar's campaigns in Gaul. His loyalty and bravery earned him Caesar's trust, making him an essential part of Caesar's retinue and setting the stage for his later political and military endeavors.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Alignment with Julius Caesar</strong><br>\nAntony's fortunes rose significantly when he aligned himself with Julius Caesar. He was appointed as one of Caesar's generals and played a crucial role in the Gallic Wars. His administrative and military roles under Caesar expanded his experience and recognition in the Roman political scene. When Caesar defeated Pompey in a civil war, Antony was chosen as his co-consul, solidifying his status at the heart of Roman politics.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
